1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Possibly born 1660 ["Trondhjems 900 Aars Jubileum Katalog for Den Historiske Udstilling i Trondhjem i 1897," (Aktietrykkeriet i Trondheim, 1897), pp. 72-73.
2 CONT
2 CONT Han var silkehandler, sykehusbestyrer og senator.
2 CONT
2 CONT Henrich Meincke was born on 7 September 1670, died on 12 September 1719 (buried on 22 September?). Businessman, deputy citizen and hospital administrator in Flensburg. Married on 19 September 1692, with Anna von Lutten, born 10 Ap
2 CONC ril 1677, died 14 September 1747. She was the daughter of Flensburg businessman and councilman, Hilmar von Lutten (1652-1722) and his first wife, Anna Lorentzen (1649-1688). They had 18 children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT W.Brandt: Slægten Benkestok, s. 182 oppgir fødselsdata 7.9.1660.
