1 NAME Karl Heinrich /Sack/
2 GIVN Karl Heinrich
2 _MARNM Sack
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 17 OCT 1789
2 ADDR
3 CITY Berlin
3 CTRY Germany
1 DEAT
2 DATE 16 OCT 1875
