1 NAME Catharina /Meincke/
2 GIVN Catharina
2 SURN Meincke
2 _MARNM Meincke
2 NICK Catharina Meincke Lysholm
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 24 JUL 1744
2 ADDR
