2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  Hans Christian Prætorius was born in about 1781 and was baptized on 10 August 1781 in the St. Croix Lutheran Church, Christiansted. He became an office clerk in Copenhagen. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  Johannes Prætorius was born in about 1785 and was baptized on 22 December 1785 in the St. Croix Lutheran Church. He was married to Charlotte Angelique [Holten ] Raupach, who was born in 1806,  on St. Thomas. He would later bec
2 CONC ome the Pastor of a church in Mors in Northern Jutland, Denmark.  She died on 21 March 1826 in Copenhagen, Denmark. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.  Wilhelmina Christina Prætorius was born in about 1787 and was baptized on 26 July 1787 in the St. Croix Lutheran Church. 
