2 CONT BIRTH: 7 May 1595, København DEATH: 21 Jan 1664, København EVENT: Kjøpte Vindingegård (senere 'Fuirendal') Father: Thomas FINCKE  Mother: Sostrata IVARIA 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1 : Jørgen FUIREN MARRIAGE: ABT 1613, (?)
