1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Agneta here''' is apparently born in [https://www.google.com/maps/place/6792+Toftum,+Tanska/@54.8127098,8.9035141,8.79z/data=!4m5!3m4!1s0x47b4cd6607527acb:0xa00afcc1d515af0!8m2!3d55.16355!4d8.5516641 '''Toftum''
2 CONC '] which is located on the island of '''Rømø''', about 20 km northwest of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/T%C3%B8nder '''Tønder''']. Tønder, on the other hand, is located right across the border from Germany, in [https://en.wikiped
2 CONC ia.org/wiki/Region_of_Southern_Denmark Syddenmark]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Ok, so his intel''' is from MyHeritage, according to which our Agneta is born in "''Toftum. Emmersbüll, Schleswig-Holstein, Deutschland''." Which is ok. Because the place in question can be no other than [https://de.wikipedia.o
2 CONC rg/wiki/Emmelsb%C3%BCll-Horsb%C3%BCll '''Emmelsbüll-Horsbüll''']. And on a map,[https://www.google.com/maps/place/25924+Emmelsb%C3%BCll-Horsb%C3%BCll,+Saksa/@54.9690693,8.5673399,10.18z/data=!4m5!3m4!1s0x47b4955e0b572d37:0x4248963
2 CONC c6582610!8m2!3d54.8157824!4d8.6876229 '''Emmelsbüll-Horsbüll'''] is right across the border, maybe 5 km from Tønder. If you click the link, you see Emmelsbüll-Horsbüll, Tønder and Rømø in the same image. More than once this discre
2 CONC pancy appears in the nearby profiles with the place being called as "Toftum bei Emmersbüll" which is correct. They are virtually the same place, by each other. It's just that the border which sort of makes this confusing, for now.
2 CONC  But once we get it right, it will be fixed. Not a biggie at all. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''There's more than''' that. It so happens that the former, '''mayor''', of Emmelsbüll-Horsbüll was an individual whose name was [http://www.emmelsbuell-horsbuell.net/index.php?pageid=10001 '''Günther Carstensen''']. Yes, indeed.
2 CONC  Günther Carstensen retired in 2013, passed away the next year, and a farmer whose name was [https://www.shz.de/lokales/nordfriesland-tageblatt/mit-knapper-mehrheit-ins-amt-id3340301.html '''Christian Carstensen'''], slightly lost
2 CONC  the election to become the next mayor. But he become the second vice mayor, though.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''These people must''' be contacted. 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT AKA Agnetha Frodsen
